{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"3056","title":"Capture Your Story: Join Xiaomi Imagery Awards 2023","desc":"Kicking off on September 26 and extending through December 31, the 2023, Xiaomi Imagery Awards 2023 welcomes creative visionaries worldwide to showcase their talent behind the lens.","view_cnt":"9187","like_cnt":"1","add_time":"1699413499","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/441_operatorx_operatorx_opx/08/11/2023/b6887ec1ebc9cd6e03ba3543fa3f99a8.png"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eBeijing, China, November 10th, 2023 - Xiaomi is excited to announce the commencement of the Xiaomi Imagery Awards 2023, inviting creative visionaries worldwide to showcase their talent behind the lens. Kicking off on September 26 and extending through December 31, 2023, this marks the fifth edition of this inclusive platform that allows photography enthusiasts and filmmakers to express their unique narratives using Xiaomi devices.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eUnder the theme, \"Your vision, your story,\" the contest aims to celebrate the beauty of individual expression through compelling imagery and videos, encouraging participants to portray their most narratives. With over 3,000 entries received from across the globe, Xiaomi has engaged various social media platforms to promote the thrilling contest.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eThis year, the awards focus on 10 distinct themes: Fleeting Moment, Portrait, Passion, Anticipation, Growth, Playful, Celebration, Local, Non-human Life, and On the Road. The diverse range of categories offers a wide range of scenarios for Xiaomi users to exhibit their creative prowess.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/49_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/08/11/2023/ed40613b18bf05eedac6b1dc573bbca0.jpg\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eAn innovative addition to this year's competition is the introduction of a short film section, emphasizing the outstanding cinematic capabilities of Xiaomi smartphones. This unique move sets Xiaomi apart, allowing contestants to dive deeper into storytelling through motion pictures, and aligns with Xiaomi's endeavor to create innovative devices that merge superior photography and videography capabilities. Entries will be scored by an acclaimed film director Victoria Hochberg, known for directing “Sex and the City\". \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Camphor Pro For XiaoMi Regular\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eFurthermore, Xiaomi's partnership with Leica has fueled a narrative centered around human emotions in imagery. Encouraging participants to capture moments that strike an emotional chord. As Xiaomi places significance on high-tonality visuals, emphasizing human emotions in the submitted content has been highlighted throughout the competition. This approach not only accentuates the emotional essence of photography but also cements Xiaomi's brand image in the domain of visual storytelling.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eThe best photograph will be rewarded with a creative fund of $5,000 and a new Leica Q3 camera. The top winner of the short film section will be granted a creative fund of $10,000, an opportunity to cooperate with Xiaomi Studios, and the top three winners from each category will embark on an offline launch event tour.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eFor further information and updates about the Xiaomi Imagery Awards 2023, please visit\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://event.mi.com/global/xiaomiImageryawards/\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ehttps://event.mi.com/global/xiaomiImageryawards/ \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eand click 'submit' to participate now!\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Camphor Pro For XiaoMi Regular\"\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Camphor Pro For XiaoMi Regular\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http://1810.HK\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e1810.HK\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones and smart hardware connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eWith an equal emphasis on innovation and quality, Xiaomi continuously pursues high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eAs of the second quarter of 2023, Xiaomi ranked among the top 3 in the global smartphone market, in terms of smartphone shipments, according to Canalys. The company has also established the world’s leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform, with 654.5 million smart devices connected to its platform, excluding smartphones, tablets and laptops, as of June 30, 2023. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In August 2023, the company listed as Fortune Global 500 for the 5th consecutive year.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Camphor Pro For XiaoMi Regular\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"6150","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1699606800"},"common":null}